LinearLayout body=row();root.addView(body,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));LinearLayout left=col();left.setBackground(shape(P,BD));left.setPadding(dp(7),dp(7),dp(7),dp(7));left.addView(label("PROJECT FILES",10,MU));ScrollView ts=new ScrollView(this);tree=col();ts.addView(tree);left.addView(ts,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));TextView add=label("+ New file",11,GR);add.setPadding(dp(4),dp(10),0,dp(8));left.addView(add);add.setOnClickListener(v->newFile());body.addView(left,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-1,.24f));
